### ============================================================
### Categories
### ============================================================

@baseUrl = {{baseUrl}}
@token = {{token}}
@categoryId = 1

### List categories
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filter by type alat
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories?type=alat
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filter by type bahan
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories?type=bahan&per_page=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Show category
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories/{{categoryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create category (alat)
POST {{baseUrl}}/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mikroskop",
  "type": "alat",
  "description": "Mikroskop optik dan elektron"
}

### Create category (bahan)
POST {{baseUrl}}/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bahan Kimia",
  "type": "bahan",
  "description": "Bahan kimia laboratorium"
}

### Update category
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/categories/{{categoryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mikroskop Updated",
  "description": "Deskripsi diperbarui"
}

### Delete category
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/categories/{{categoryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
